stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: API commits a new job
    Pending --> Running: Worker atomically claims job
    Running --> Completed: Candidates or no-match committed
    Running --> Failed: Error, timeout, or interrupted worker
    Completed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    note right of Completed
        result_kind = candidates or no_candidates
        Review and phone saving are separate
        Expired media requires a new request key
    end note
    note right of Failed
        Explicit retry creates a NEW pending job
        The failed attempt remains immutable
    end note
